    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Real Shopify Sync\nPulls abandoned checkouts from the live dev store (GraphQL, `abandonedCheckouts`) and upserts them into our own `carts` table, which tracks touch_count/state.\n\n**If this returns empty:** not necessarily an error - dev stores can take time (or need a paid plan) before Shopify itself flags a checkout as abandoned. Check Shopify admin -> Orders -> Abandoned checkouts to confirm. Full troubleshooting: see README.md.",
        "height": 788,
        "width": 2884,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "da3f8a47-b775-4fb1-9aa3-515147fb9aaf",
      "name": "Note: Shopify Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -704,
        -448
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Segmentation, Dry-Run, and Send\nCarts eligible for a touch (touch_count < 3, spaced 20hrs+ apart) get routed by value/touch-number, messaged, and sent - unless `dry_run = true`, in which case nothing sends and results just log.\n\n**Flip dry_run to false only after reviewing at least one full dry-run cycle.** Send nodes need a real email credential attached before they'll work. See README.md troubleshooting table for per-node fixes.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 756
      },
      "id": "83806e57-8544-49d1-b368-7ac1725a1ffe",
      "name": "Note: Segmentation & Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -128,
        -1152
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stop-on-Conversion\nReal order placed -> stops the recovery sequence for that customer immediately. Locally this can only be tested by sending a manual POST (n8n 'Listen for test event') - a real Shopify webhook needs this instance exposed via ngrok/Cloudflare Tunnel to reach it.",
        "height": 390,
        "width": 1508,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "e406de3b-ac7c-4604-bff5-44d84f8a9f4b",
      "name": "Note: Order Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
