      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Win-Back Branch\nIndependent daily scan, reads the `customers` table (seeded via schema.sql), not tied to Shopify. Good branch to test while waiting on real Shopify data to age into 'abandoned' status.",
        "height": 294,
        "width": 2500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "dd0e2bc3-31f2-4f51-a921-32db09098932",
      "name": "Note: Win-Back Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1088,
        544
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Unsubscribe Webhook\nHit when a recipient clicks the unsubscribe link in any email. Marks the email `unsubscribed = true` in both `carts` and `customers` — a real unsubscribe should stop cart-recovery AND win-back, not just whichever email they clicked from. Same local-testing constraint as the order webhook: needs ngrok/Cloudflare Tunnel to actually receive a real click from outside this machine. The link's domain in the email templates (`northfield-outfitters-demo.com`) is a placeholder — swap for the real production domain (or the current tunnel URL, for local testing) before this link actually works end to end.",
        "height": 310,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "6f3a9d2e-4c8b-4e1a-9d6f-2b8e4c1a9d3f",
